1
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,420
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,360
=Episode 18=

3
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:16,519
(Stab yourselves with your swords.)

4
00:01:16,879 --> 00:01:18,000
(Die to live.)

5
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,400
(That breaks the illusion.)

6
00:01:22,359 --> 00:01:23,159
(Ziyan,)

7
00:01:24,519 --> 00:01:26,640
(If you cannot find the Twin Hands,)

8
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:29,319
(there is one final option.)

9
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,959
(Use your life as a bridge.)

10
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:38,000
(Let the Wind God Chronicle
merge with the Stone inside her.)

11
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:42,799
(She will gain the Chronicle's power)

12
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,799
(and separate from the Divine Stone.)

13
00:01:46,239 --> 00:01:47,400
(The sky will be mended.)

14
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,239
(She will live.)

15
00:01:49,239 --> 00:01:50,560
(But you)

16
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,280
(will perish.)

17
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:11,759
Yuanchu.

18
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:13,919
What are you doing?

19
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,520
Stop this right now!

20
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:17,960
Stop!

21
00:02:18,599 --> 00:02:19,960
Please stop!

22
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:22,000
Stop this!

23
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,400
This time,

24
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,599
once again,

25
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,280
with my life,

26
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:32,479
I trade for yours.

27
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,479
No!

28
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,159
Yuanchu,

29
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:53,879
Yuanchu, are you all right?

30
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,680
I love you.

31
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,919
You wretched pair!

32
00:03:30,639 --> 00:03:32,039
How dare you scheme against me!

33
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,879
Your greed is boundless.

34
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,240
In the end, you'll have nothing.

35
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,039
Very well.

36
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:41,800
I will take both the Divine Stone

37
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:43,280
and the Wind God Chronicle for myself.

38
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:58,800
What...

39
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,240
What is happening?

40
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:07,800
Thunder.

41
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:39,920
Hahaha!

42
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,319
You still dare to fight me?

43
00:04:45,439 --> 00:04:46,240
Hmph.

44
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:00,639
Purestone Bloom.

45
00:05:03,439 --> 00:05:06,800
The Chronicle and the Stone have fused.

46
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:14,879
Chi Xiao of the Demon Hunting Bureau,

47
00:05:15,199 --> 00:05:16,199
dares to betray me?

48
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:19,399
I serve the land and its people.

49
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,920
Not one person's greed.

50
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:23,560
Fine. Since you ask for it,

51
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,040
I will grant your wish.

52
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:27,600
I will grind you both to dust.

53
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:34,480
My flesh. My bones. You shall not pass.

54
00:05:36,319 --> 00:05:37,920
You dare obstruct my great work?

55
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,879
You dare oppose me?

56
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,240
Delusional!

57
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,439
I told you before.

58
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:03,639
The Divine Stone
and both realms are mine.

59
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,480
Thunder strikes!

60
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,360
Chi Xiao!

61
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,759
Chi Xiao!

62
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:37,800
Chi Xiao!

63
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,279
- Chi Xiao, hold on!
- Chi Xiao!

64
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,160
- Chi Xiao!
- Chi Xiao!

65
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:46,800
Are you alright?

66
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:51,040
Thunderdragon Strike.

67
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:55,000
A move that can only be used once
in a lifetime.

68
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,319
This time,

69
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:03,399
I have finally protected you.

70
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,360
Hold on.

71
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,600
There must be another way.

72
00:07:12,279 --> 00:07:13,079
Stay with me.

73
00:07:14,759 --> 00:07:15,560
Hmph.

74
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,720
It is no use.

75
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,279
Chi Xiao!

76
00:07:23,399 --> 00:07:24,199
I'm sorry...

77
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,959
this is as far

78
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,519
as I can go.

79
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,879
No.

80
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:44,720
If there is a next life,

81
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:48,759
I hope

82
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:51,319
I get to meet you first.

83
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,399
(Chi Xiao, you should smile more often.)

84
00:08:12,399 --> 00:08:14,759
(Just like this.)

85
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:21,959
(Look, Chi Xiao.)

86
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:44,720
Let me

87
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,799
stand by your side.

88
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:49,000
Will you let me?

89
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:52,919
Will you?

90
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,039
Will you?

91
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,480
Chi Xiao!

92
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,039
Chi Xiao!

93
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:02,159
You're going to be fine.

94
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:13,919
- Chi Xiao!
- Chi Xiao!

95
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,000
- Chi Xiao!
- Chi Xiao!

96
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,000
Chi Xiao!

97
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:28,679
- Chi Xiao!
- Chi Xiao!

98
00:09:29,799 --> 00:09:30,600
Chi Xiao!

99
00:09:33,559 --> 00:09:34,360
Traitor.

100
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,320
At least you died for something.

101
00:09:48,919 --> 00:09:49,720
Chi Xiao!

102
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:56,240
I will take your life

103
00:09:56,519 --> 00:09:58,000
to avenge Chi Xiao!

104
00:09:59,279 --> 00:10:00,440
Heaven and earth, grant me power.

105
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:01,799
Strike down evil!

106
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,120
Hmph.

107
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,919
You can't die yet.

108
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:20,879
In that case,

109
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,639
I will show you

110
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:27,559
what the Twin Hands can truly do.

111
00:10:28,679 --> 00:10:30,559
So you can die knowing the truth.

112
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,519
Ah!

113
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:44,919
Ziyan!

114
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:46,200
Ziyan!

115
00:10:46,679 --> 00:10:48,080
Mm.

116
00:10:49,399 --> 00:10:50,200
Mm.

117
00:10:56,559 --> 00:10:57,360
Ziyan!

118
00:11:02,919 --> 00:11:03,720
Ziyan!

119
00:11:06,159 --> 00:11:06,960
Ziyan!

120
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,399
Ziyan!

121
00:11:15,879 --> 00:11:16,960
Stop!

122
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:17,759
Ziyan!

123
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,240
I've done it.

124
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:44,159
I've done it!

125
00:11:45,559 --> 00:11:52,500
Hahaha!

126
00:11:53,399 --> 00:11:54,799
I've done it!

127
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:59,240
Hahaha!

128
00:12:00,159 --> 00:12:02,720
The world is mine!

129
00:12:03,399 --> 00:12:05,200
Hahaha!

130
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:08,159
Both realms are mine to command!

131
00:12:08,159 --> 00:12:11,960
Hahaha!

132
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:29,799
Yu Linjun?

133
00:12:51,097 --> 00:12:55,025
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

134
00:12:55,297 --> 00:12:58,470
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

135
00:12:58,511 --> 00:13:02,025
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

136
00:13:02,211 --> 00:13:05,145
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

137
00:13:05,425 --> 00:13:12,195
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

138
00:13:12,841 --> 00:13:19,529
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

139
00:13:20,435 --> 00:13:24,105
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

140
00:13:24,215 --> 00:13:27,905
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

141
00:13:28,077 --> 00:13:34,311
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
